{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/243522-abyssal-charm-exquisite-relic-bow-errata","id":243522,"title":"Abyssal Charm - Exquisite Relic Bow Errata","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-28T19:06:06-07:00","id":243522,"title":"Abyssal Charm - Exquisite Relic Bow Errata","content":"Hi everyone. I was just reviewing this particular Charm, Exquisite Relic Bow from <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Manual of Exalted Power: The Abyssals P. 125, and checking errata on it. Let me set the scene a bit.<br /> <br /> Exquisite Relic Bow is a mirror of Immaculate Golden Bow. Immaculate Golden Bow has received errata to mimic Glorious Solar Saber, which received errata so that it now creates a 1, 2, or 3 dot artifact weapon. Resplendent Shadow Blade has also receive this errata. However, Exquisite Relic Bow has not. Do people think this is an oversight, or a deliberate choice? </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T19:53:25-07:00","id":243550,"title":"","content":"Oversight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1910-seconis","name":"Seconis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T20:12:32-07:00","id":243557,"title":"","content":"As the guy who I think handled the Abyssals 2.5 errata, yeah, that's an oversight. It should work just like Immaculate Golden Bow was changed to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T20:33:11-07:00","id":243583,"title":"","content":"Ok, figured, because everything else lined up like it should.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T20:39:25-07:00","id":243585,"title":"","content":"Robert Vance, can I also assume that if the Charm in the Abyssals book has no rules, and merely refers back to the Mirrored Solar Charm, that if the Solar Charm has received errata, the Abyssal Charm should receive the same errata?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T23:53:25-07:00","id":243671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ejtaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/243522-abyssal-charm-exquisite-relic-bow-errata?p=243585#post243585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Robert Vance, can I also assume that if the Charm in the Abyssals book has no rules, and merely refers back to the Mirrored Solar Charm, that if the Solar Charm has received errata, the Abyssal Charm should receive the same errata?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. Straight-up mirrors should always work like the Charm they mirror, including errata.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T03:19:23-07:00","id":243809,"title":"","content":"Since <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Immaculate Golden Bow </span></span></span> has the Holy keyword like Glorious Solar Saber, does that mean Exquisite Relic Bow also have a second purchase like Respledent Shadow Blade ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T11:45:18-07:00","id":244231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/243522-abyssal-charm-exquisite-relic-bow-errata?p=243809#post243809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Immaculate Golden Bow </span></span></span> has the Holy keyword like Glorious Solar Saber, does that mean Exquisite Relic Bow also have a second purchase like Respledent Shadow Blade ?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's been multiple hours since I looked at those two, so I have almost no memory of them, but I think that is the case. Immaculate Golden Bow specifically says it is the same as Glorious Golden Sabre, so I would assume that Exquisite Relic Bow is the same as Resplendent Shadow Blade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}